flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Load accounts and transactions from files]
    B --> C[Display main menu]
    C --> D{User choice}
    D -->|1 Create account| E[Read name and validate 4-digit PIN]
    E --> F[Assign account number and set balance to zero]
    F --> G[Save account to accounts.txt]
    G --> C
    D -->|2 Log in| H[Read account number and PIN]
    H --> I{Credentials valid?}
    I -->|No| J[Show login error]
    J --> C
    I -->|Yes| K[Display account menu]
    K --> L{Account action}
    L -->|Check balance| M[Display balance]
    L -->|Deposit| N[Validate amount and add to balance]
    L -->|Withdraw| O{Sufficient funds?}
    O -->|No| P[Show insufficient funds]
    O -->|Yes| Q[Subtract amount from balance]
    L -->|Transfer| R[Find recipient and validate amount]
    R --> S{Recipient valid and funds sufficient?}
    S -->|No| T[Show transfer error]
    S -->|Yes| U[Update both balances]
    L -->|History| V[Display transactions for account]
    M --> W[Save changes when required]
    N --> W
    Q --> W
    U --> W
    P --> K
    T --> K
    V --> K
    W --> X{Log out?}
    X -->|No| K
    X -->|Yes| C
    D -->|3 Exit| Y[Save data files]
    Y --> Z([End])
